  "answer": "The software requirement for iPhones supporting AirDrop's ability to continue transmitting over the web/internet when out of range is iOS 17.1 or later. Apple's iPhone User Guide for iOS 17.1 (support.apple.com/en-hk/guide/iphone/iphcd8b9f0af/17.1/ios/17.1) states: 'If you leave Bluetooth or Wi-Fi range after an AirDrop transfer is initiated, the transfer continues over the internet.' iPhones need iOS 17.1 or later for AirDrop transfers to continue over the internet when out of Bluetooth/Wi-Fi range.",
